# Copy to benchmark/.env (ignored by git) and fill in. Read by gtfs_bench.credentials,
# which falls back to environment variables, then to an interactive prompt.
#
# The catalogue's `auth` column names the key a feed needs: auth=grandlyon reads
# GRANDLYON_USER and GRANDLYON_PASSWORD.

# Data Grand Lyon — official TCL GTFS, HTTP Basic.
# A free GrandLyon Connect account; the API password is set separately through
# "mot de passe oublié": https://rdata-grandlyon.readthedocs.io/fr/latest/authentification.html
GRANDLYON_USER=
GRANDLYON_PASSWORD=
